35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The cooler notice stayed up all summer. People were sweating to save money.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The bills swing wildly. February was 29k, August 9k. Meters cost 34k per room.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"At another house, settling takes forty minutes. The template trial was a nightmare.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,One room uses four times more than another. The last move-in took three weeks to settle.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Three months were paid late because people questioned the amounts. It’s causing stress.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, 34k per room is a lot. Can we afford that upfront?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
