45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I don't want to pay for someone else's heater.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,A fixed seasonal rate might smooth out the peaks and troughs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"If we do meters, I need a simple way to track it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Meters are accurate but expensive. Fixed rates are simpler but maybe unfair.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,Simplicity might be better for our relationships.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I lean towards something that doesn't require daily math.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I need to weigh the upfront cost against the yearly savings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I vote for whatever takes the least time to manage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I want accuracy, but I also want peace.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's choose the option that stops the arguments.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
